Package: cz-tailscale
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: InstantComet <10364622+InstantComet@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, openssh-client
Recommends: tailscale
Homepage: https://github.com/InstantComet/cz-tailscale
Description: Peers: unofficial Tailscale device list for the CardputerZero launcher
 Lists the devices on your tailnet with their state and connection path, and
 lets you log in by scanning a QR code, SSH to a device in the launcher's
 built-in terminal, copy its address,
 tailscale ping it, choose an exit node, and turn Tailscale on or off.
 .
 Unofficial app, not affiliated with or endorsed by Tailscale Inc.
 Tailscale is a registered trademark of Tailscale Inc.
